\## 11. Planned Backend Components



```text

backend/app/

├── api/routes/

│   └── sommelier.py

├── schemas/

│   └── sommelier.py

├── services/

│   └── sommelier\_service.py

└── core/

&#x20;   └── config.py

```



Responsibilities:



\### `schemas/sommelier.py`



Defines the API request and response models.



\### `services/sommelier\_service.py`



Will handle:



\* candidate retrieval

\* context formatting

\* Gemini requests

\* recommendation validation

\* Suggest Again exclusions

\* provider error handling



\### `api/routes/sommelier.py`



Will expose the FastAPI endpoint used by the frontend.



\### `core/config.py`



Will provide server-side Gemini configuration.



